# /etc/systemd/system/news-fetch.timer
# REPLACED BY CRON: /labs/cron/tomlabs-news-fetch
#
# This systemd timer unit has been DEACTIVATED in favor of cron,
# which is lighter weight and more reliable in containerized deployments.
#
# Cron schedule: every minute (* * * * *) via /labs/cron/tomlabs-news-fetch
# Admin control is unchanged — fetch.php reads global_settings.news_settings.
#
# Do not re-enable this timer while cron is active — duplicate runs would occur.
